{
  "id": "section-combat",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Combat\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,407,414]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you encounter monsters,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,414,443]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "note down their number and level\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,443,476]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(L). A monster’s L is a measure of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,476,511]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "how dangerous it is.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,511,532]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You and the monster/s will take\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,532,564]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "turns attacking each other. You go\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,564,599]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "first, unless the monster surprised\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,599,635]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you (some monsters have a chance\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,635,668]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of surprising you; it’s written in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,668,703]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "their description).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,703,723]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "To attack, roll d6, adding any\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,723,754]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "modifiers that apply for Skills and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,754,790]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapons, and divide the total by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,790,823]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the monster’s L, rounding down.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,823,855]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The result is the number of damage\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,855,890]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "points you inflict.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,890,910]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Example: You attack a L3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,910,935]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "monster. Your die roll is a 4,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,935,966]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and you add +2 due to the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,966,992]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapon you are using. Your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,992,1019]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "total is 6. 6/3= 2.  You inflict 2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1019,1054]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage upon the creature.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1054,1080]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you attack a group of monsters\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1080,1114]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with 1 Life point each, each\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1114,1143]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Damage point kills one of them.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1143,1175]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Example: You attack a group\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1175,1203]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of six L3 Zombies with 1 Life\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1203,1233]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "each. Your Attack total is 7.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1233,1263]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "7/3= 2.  You kill 2 zombies.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1263,1292]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If the monster has more than 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1292,1323]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Life, each Damage point will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1323,1352]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "deplete one of its Life points. A\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1352,1386]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "monster dies if reduced to 0 or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1386,1418]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fewer Life points.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1418,1437]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Example: You attack an L4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1437,1463]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Vampire with 8 Life. You roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1463,1493]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a total of 8, inflicting 2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1493,1520]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "damage. The vampire now\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1520,1544]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "has 6 Life points.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1544,1563]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When it’s the monsters’ turn to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1563,1595]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attack, only the monsters that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1595,1626]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "survived your attack have a chance\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1626,1661]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to hurt you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1661,1674]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Example: If you face 6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1674,1697]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "zombies and kill 2,  you will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1697,1727]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0046",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have to defend only against\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1727,1755]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0047",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the 4 remaining zombies. The\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1755,1784]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0048",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2 zombies you killed do not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1784,1812]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0049",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "get a chance to strike you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1812,1840]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0050",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Some weapons inflict more than 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1840,1873]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0051",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "point of damage. In that case, every\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1873,1910]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0052",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "hit inflicts the weapon’s damage.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[29,1910,1943]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0053",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Example: you shoot at a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,22,46]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0054",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "group of L3 zombies with a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,46,73]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0055",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "shotgun (2 damage per hit).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,73,101]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0056",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Your total roll is a 7. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,101,129]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0057",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "inflict a total of 4 damage on\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,129,160]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0058",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the zombies, because you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,160,185]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-combat:p0059",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolled twice their level.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[31,185,211]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    29,
    31
  ]
}
